,$ the sequence is convergent and converges to ${a}_{1}$\n\n- if $r=-1,$ the sequence is divergent\n\nThe  given sequence is a geometric sequence with the common ratio \n\n$$\nr=\\frac{{a}_{2}}{{a}_{1}}=\\frac{2}{10}=\\frac{1}{5}.\n$$\n\nSince $|r|=\\frac{1}{5}<1,$ the sequence converges to $0.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-0e4a19b8-958e-5dff-be75-386c1c3b76d5"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-0e4a19b8-958e-5dff-be75-386c1c3b76d5" :answer-field/id #uuid "0e4a19b8-958e-5dff-be75-386c1c3b76d5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-6abef644-5ea5-5c64-879a-d7838c957bfb" :answer-field/choices ["answer-6abef644-5ea5-5c64-879a-d7838c957bfb" "answer-ffcc356c-b412-5227-abb8-fe43326ed66d" "answer-c0da4df6-9e56-5258-90c7-b4c9aed9e2d6" "answer-227c9f2d-5f48-5e53-b201-ffea5668ea23" "answer-0b509215-bc4b-5867-9d72-f3a07315a945"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6abef644-5ea5-5c64-879a-d7838c957bfb" :answer/id #uuid "6abef644-5ea5-5c64-879a-d7838c957bfb" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Converges to $0$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ffcc356c-b412-5227-abb8-fe43326ed66d" :answer/id #uuid "ffcc356c-b412-5227-abb8-fe43326ed66d" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Converges to $5$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c0da4df6-9e56-5258-90c7-b4c9aed9e2d6" :answer/id #uuid "c0da4df6-9e56-5258-90c7-b4c9aed9e2d6" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Converges to $\\frac{1}{5}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-227c9f2d-5f48-5e53-b201-ffea5668ea23" :answer/id #uuid "227c9f2d-5f48-5e53-b201-ffea5668ea23" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Converges to $\\frac{2}{5}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0b509215-bc4b-5867-9d72-f3a07315a945" :answer/id #uuid "0b509215-bc4b-5867-9d72-f3a07315a945" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "The sequence diverges" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-affca196-0a76-5ce7-a774-751bad763eba" :question/id #uuid "affca196-0a76-5ce7-a774-751bad763eba" :question/math-academy-id "q-141402" :question/problem "Consider the following geometric sequence:\n\n$$\n4,\\,4,\\,4,\\,4,\\,…\n$$\n\nDetermine whether the sequence is convergent or divergent. If it converges, find the limit." :question/worked-solution "Suppose we have a geometric sequence with the first term ${a}_{1}$ and common ratio $r.$ Then, we have the following convergence properties:\n\n- if $|r|<1,$ the sequence is convergent and converges to $0$\n\n- if $|r|>1,$ the sequence is divergent\n\nMoreover, we have the following edge cases:\n\n- if $r=1,$ the sequence is convergent and converges to ${a}_{1}$\n\n- if $r=-1,$ the sequence is divergent\n\nThe  given sequence is a geometric sequence with the common ratio \n\n$$\nr=\\frac{{a}_{2}}{{a}_{1}}=\\frac{4}{4}=1.\n$$\n\nSince $r=1,$ i.e., the sequence converges and converges to $4.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-e30e6f9b-a485-59d3-ad42-8469332526d2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-e30e6f9b-a485-59d3-ad42-8469332526d2" :answer-field/id #uuid "e30e6f9b-a485-59d3-ad42-8469332526d2" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-6762f035-51d1-5181-849a-a23f543f682d" :answer-field/choices ["answer-c224abce-12d0-565b-9938-798152f266f0" "answer-efc1a9f2-79b6-5ef4-b66d-ce625c4e0c40" "answer-6762f035-51d1-5181-849a-a23f543f682d" "answer-d0046bb4-9279-5694-ac3f-b84d3fb522dc" "answer-c3d1b847-2910-57db-b0b5-a0f6bad643bd"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c224abce-12d0-565b-9938-798152f266f0" :answer/id #uuid "c224abce-12d0-565b-9938-798152f266f0" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Converges to $-4$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-efc1a9f2-79b6-5ef4-b66d-ce625c