rgent and converges to $0$\n\n- if $|r|>1,$ the sequence is divergent\n\nMoreover, we have the following edge cases:\n\n- if $r=1,$ the sequence is convergent and converges to ${a}_{1}$\n\n- if $r=-1,$ the sequence is divergent\n\nThe given sequence ${a}_{n}={(\\frac{1}{3})}^{n}$ is a geometric sequence with the common ratio $r=\\frac{1}{3}.$ \n\nSince $|r|<1,$ the sequence converges to $0.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-10e0e870-79e6-5269-8219-f111bea6724e"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-10e0e870-79e6-5269-8219-f111bea6724e" :answer-field/id #uuid "10e0e870-79e6-5269-8219-f111bea6724e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-6f73333b-5cfb-5877-8c66-ac9eb035d9f0" :answer-field/choices ["answer-6f73333b-5cfb-5877-8c66-ac9eb035d9f0" "answer-9c49a9ab-cd6b-511d-a833-b6c98969e6b6" "answer-cfddbddc-36a7-5624-b962-52672817ca61" "answer-dcb5ed18-5d59-5f9b-9672-ad4a238557bc" "answer-2f9f6a47-c2c2-5fa8-97fd-d0cb079eddcf"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6f73333b-5cfb-5877-8c66-ac9eb035d9f0" :answer/id #uuid "6f73333b-5cfb-5877-8c66-ac9eb035d9f0" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Converges to $0$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9c49a9ab-cd6b-511d-a833-b6c98969e6b6" :answer/id #uuid "9c49a9ab-cd6b-511d-a833-b6c98969e6b6" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Converges to $1$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-cfddbddc-36a7-5624-b962-52672817ca61" :answer/id #uuid "cfddbddc-36a7-5624-b962-52672817ca61" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Converges to $3$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-dcb5ed18-5d59-5f9b-9672-ad4a238557bc" :answer/id #uuid "dcb5ed18-5d59-5f9b-9672-ad4a238557bc" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Converges to $\\frac{1}{3}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2f9f6a47-c2c2-5fa8-97fd-d0cb079eddcf" :answe