vergent\n\nMoreover, we have the following edge cases:\n\n- if $r=1,$ the sequence is convergent and converges to ${a}_{1}$\n\n- if $r=-1,$ the sequence is divergent\n\nThe given sequence ${a}_{n}={(-\\frac{1}{4})}^{n}$ is a geometric sequence with the common ratio $r=-\\frac{1}{4}.$ \n\nSince $|r|<1,$ the sequence converges to $0.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-8b187301-010a-588f-b659-02825864087e"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-8b187301-010a-588f-b659-02825864087e" :answer-field/id #uuid "8b187301-010a-588f-b659-02825864087e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-39785d70-5b85-5e05-900c-2d6c11e32e31" :answer-field/choices ["answer-05ecdca3-fcb7-5b1a-a77c-df2a4df16806" "answer-39785d70-5b85-5e05-900c-2d6c11e32e31" "answer-52ccd38c-07a3-5300-bc3e-b4fe965d6250" "answer-28080ad3-ed82-5c7d-8bb0-0bcb51047eea" "answer-e23ca2e8-2498-53f3-9396-eb918f8eb895"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-05ecdca3-fcb7-5b1a-a77c-df2a4df16806" :answer/id #uuid "05ecdca3-fcb7-5b1a-a77c-df2a4df16806" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Converges to $-\\frac{1}{4}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-39785d70-5b85-5e05-900c-2d6c11e32e31" :answer/id #uuid "39785d70-5b85-5e05-900c-2d6c11e32e31" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Converges to $0$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-52ccd38c-07a3-5300-bc3e-b4fe965d6250" :answer/id #uuid "52ccd38c-07a3-5300-bc3e-b4fe965d6250" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Converges to $1$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-28080ad3-ed82-5c7d-8bb0-0bcb51047eea" :answer/id #uuid "28080ad3-ed82-5c7d-8bb0-0bcb51047eea" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Converges to $\\frac{1}{4}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e23ca2e8-2498-53f3-9396-eb918f8eb895" :answer/id #uuid "e23ca2e8-2498-53f3-9396-eb918f8eb895